# Skill Contract

## Authority

Read:
1. Claude.md
2. applicable policies/
3. relevant root context/
4. relevant context/seo/ files

Do not override policy or source-of-truth hierarchy.

## Evidence

Use CONFIRMED / LIKELY / UNKNOWN.
Never invent facts, metrics, customers or capabilities.

## Scope

This skill does not independently write business-process fields to Zoho CRM.

## Approval

High-impact website changes require HUMAN APPROVAL before implementation/publication.

## Failure behavior

Use DATA GAP, DATA CONFLICT, POLICY BLOCK or HUMAN APPROVAL REQUIRED where appropriate.

# Keyword Clustering Skill

## Purpose

Convert raw keywords into coherent search-intent/topic clusters.

## Procedure

1. Group by intent.
2. Group by underlying business problem.
3. Identify the dominant topic.
4. Determine whether an existing page should own the cluster.
5. Identify pillar/service/supporting relationships.
6. Detect cannibalization.
7. Recommend one primary URL purpose per cluster.

## Output

For each cluster:
Cluster
Primary Keyword
Secondary Keywords
Intent
Buyer Stage
Primary URL
Supporting Topics
Service
Internal Link Targets
Priority
Rationale
